          <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#linear-elastic-beams'>Material Behavior: linear elastic beams</a>
              <ul class='list-group list-group-flush py-0'> 
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#first-moi'>First Moment of Area: Centroid of an Area</a></li> 
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#second-moi'>Second Moment or Area Moment of Inertia</a></li>
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#summary-moi'>Summary: Moment of Inertia</a></li>
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#max-normal-stress'>Maximum Normal Stress</a></li>
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/bending#eccentric-loading'>Eccentric Axial Loading in a Plane of Symmetry</a></li>  
              </ul>
          </li>  
        </ul>
      </CourseCard> 

      <CourseCard href="/sol/transverse_shear" img_src="/sol/home_page/transverse_shear.png" title="Transverse shear">
        <ul class='list-group list-group-flush py-0'> 
          <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsection' href='/sol/transverse_shear#shear_in_beams'>Shear Stress in Beams</a></li>
          <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsection' href='/sol/transverse_shear#avg_shear_stress'>Average Shear Stress</a>
              <ul class='list-group list-group-flush py-0'> 
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/transverse_shear#rect_beam'>Rectangular Beam Cross-Section</a></li> 
                  <li class='list-group-item py-0'><a class='text-decoration-none subsubsection' href='/sol/transverse_shear#i_beam'>I-Shaped Beam Cross-Section</a></li>  
